    {
      "en": "The package uses the shared linear inline rule; like the reference it scans to the next marker, rejects unescaped whitespace in the content and unescapes backslash escapes. Every correctness case renders identical HTML, so no case is a documented difference.",
      "zh": "该包使用共享的线性行内规则；与参考包一样，它会扫描到下一个标记、拒绝内容中未转义的空白并反转义反斜杠转义。所有正确性用例渲染出的 HTML 完全相同，因此没有用例属于已记录差异。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Scaling: the scanner stops at the next marker character, so repeated unmatched openers do not rescan the remaining line, and `long-inline-run` scans its content once. `inline-superscripts`, `unmatched-openers` and `long-inline-run` all fit a near-linear exponent on both sides; no superlinear path was found.",
      "zh": "扩展性：扫描器在下一个标记字符处停止，因此重复的未匹配开标记不会重新扫描该行剩余部分，`long-inline-run` 也只扫描其内容一次。`inline-superscripts`、`unmatched-openers` 和 `long-inline-run` 在两侧的拟合指数都接近线性；未发现超线性路径。"
